{"strongs": "H2205", "word": "זָקֵן", "translit": "za.qen", "root": "זקן", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "old", "definition": "זָקֵן adjective old , absolute ׳ ז Gen 19:4 + 30 t. (on distinction from verb see above); construct זְקַן Gen 24:2 plural זְקֵנִים Gen 18:11 + 44 t.; זְקֵנוֺת Zech 8:4 construct זִקְנֵי Gen 50:7 + 85 t.; suffix זְקֵנַי Lam 1:19 , זְקֵנֶיךָ Deut 21:2 ; Deut 32:7 , זְקֵנָיו Josh 8:33 + 3 t., זְקֵנֶיהָ Judg 8:14 , זְקֵנֵינוּ Exod 10:9 ; Josh 9:11 , זִקְנֵיכֶם Deut 5:20 + 2 t.; — 1. old , of human beings, as adjective predicate Gen 18:11 ( J ), Job 32:4 ( מִמֶּנּוּ לְיָמִים ׳ ז , in comparison), or attributive אָב זָקֵן Gen 44:20 ( J ), ׳ אִישׁ ז Judg 19:16 ; Judg 19:17 ; Judg 19:20 ; Judg 19:22 , ׳ נָבִיא ז 1Kgs 13:11 ; 1Kgs 13:25 ; 1Kgs 13:29 , ׳ מֶלֶךְ ז Eccl 4:13 probably also וּשְׂבַע ימים ׳ ז Gen 35:29 ( P ), Job 42:17 and Gen 25:8 ( P ) according to ᵐ5 Sam Di ; compare also Ezra 3:12 . 2. usually as substantive: \\ \\ a. old man (or woman), \\ \\ b. elder ; \\ \\ a. old man Gen 43:27 ( J ), Lev 19:32 ( H ), Deut 28:50 ; Deut 32:7 (|| אָב ), 1Sam 2:31 ; 1Sam 2:32 ; 1Sam 28:14 ; Isa 47:6 ; Job 12:20 ; Job 32:9 ; Prov 17:6 ; Prov 20:29 ; Ps 119:100 ; Joel 1:2 old men and old women Zech 8:4 (twice in verse); compare זְקַן בֵּיתוֺ Gen 24:2 ( J ), זִקְנֵי בֵיתוֺ 2Sam 12:17 especially opposed to נַעַר Exod 10:9 ( E ), Isa 3:5 ; Isa 20:4 ; Jer 51:22 ; Lam 2:21 ; Ps 148:12 , and in phrase מִנַּעַר וְעַד זָקֵן Gen 19:4 ( J ), Josh 6:21 ( J E ), Esth 3:13 opposed to ילדים 1Kgs 12:6 ; 1Kgs 12:8 ; 1Kgs 12:13 = 2Chr 10:6 ; 2Chr 10:8 ; 2Chr 10:13 opposed to בַּחוּרִים Jer 31:13 ; Ezek 9:6 ; Joel 3:1 , compare 2Chr 36:17 (+ יָשֵׁשׁ ) and Jer 6:11 (+ מְלֵא ימים ); opposed to עוּל ימים Isa 65:20 opposed to יונקי שׁדים and עוללים Joel 2:16 . \\ \\ b. usually plural elders , as having authority, term techn. (100 t. +); elders of a people, especially Israel Exod 3:16 ; Exod 3:18 ; Exod 12:21 (all J ), Exod 17:5 ; Exod 17:6 ; Exod 18:12 ; Exod 19:7 ; Exod 24:1 ; Exod 24:9 ; Exod 24:14 ; Josh 24:1 (all E ), Num 11:16 (twice in verse) ( שֹׁטְרָיו ), v Num 11:24 v Num 11:25 v Num 11:30 ; Num 16:25 ; Josh 7:6 ; Josh 8:10 ; Josh 9:11 (all J E ), Deut 5:20 (|| רָאשֵׁי שִׁבְטֵיכֶם ), Deut 27:1 ; Deut 29:9 (|| ראשׁי שׁבטיכם , שֹׁטְרֵיכֶם ), Deut 31:9 ; Deut 31:28 ; Josh 8:33 (|| שֹׁטְרִים וְשֹׁפְטָיו ), Josh 23:2 (|| רָאשׁיו , שֹׁפְטָיו , שֹׁטְרָיו ); compare also probably Josh 24:31 = Judg 2:7 (all D ); Lev 9:1 , compare זִקְנֵי הָעֵדָה Lev 4:15 ( both P ), Judg 21:16 see also 1Sam 4:3 ; 1Sam 8:4 ; 1Sam 15:30 ; 2Sam 3:17 ; 2Sam 5:3 = 1Chr 11:3 ; 2Sam 17:4 ; 2Sam 17:15 ; 1Kgs 8:1 ; 1Kgs 8:3 = 2Chr 5:2 ; 2Chr 5:4 , also 1Chr 15:25 ; 1Chr 21:16 compare Isa 3:2 ( גִּבּוֺר וְאִישׁ מִלְחָמָ֑ה ׳ שׁוֺפֵט וְנָבִיא וְקֹסֵם וְז ), Isa 9:14 (|| נְשׂוּאפָֿנִים , but see probably gloss, compare Ew Che Di Du and others); elders of one tribe (Judah) 1Sam 30:26 ; 2Sam 19:12 , so of Gilead Judg 11:5 ; Judg 11:7 ; Judg 11:8 ; Judg 11:9 ; Judg 11:10 ; Judg 11:11 after the division of the kingdoms, of Northern Israel זקני הארץ 1Kgs 20:7 compare v 1Kgs 20:8 , also 2Kgs 6:32 (twice in verse); 2Kgs 10:1 (|| שָׂרִים etc.) compare v 2Kgs 10:5 under Josiah זקני יְהוּדָה 2Kgs 23:1 = 2Chr 34:29 see also הארץ ׳ ז Jer 26:17 , compare זקני ארץ Prov 31:23 , compare Lam 1:19 ; Lam 2:10 ; Lam 4:16 ; Lam 5:12 ; Lam 5:14 (|| שׂרים ; + שַׁעַר ); often in Ezek.: Ezek 7:26 (|| כהן ), of Judah Ezek 8:1 , of Israel Ezek 8:11 ; Ezek 8:12 ; Ezek 14:1 ; Ezek 20:1 ; Ezek 20:3 , also Ezek 9:6 (but strike out Co ). Exilic הַגּוֺלָה ׳ ז Jer 29:1 (|| הכהנים , הנביאים ); post-exile Ezra 10:8 (|| שׂרים ), possibly also Joel 1:14 elders of ׳ י Isa 24:23 (compare Exod 24:1 ; Exod 24:9 ), זִקְנֵי הַכֹּהֲנִים 2Kgs 19:2 = Isa 37:2 , so Jer 19:1 (|| זקני העם ); of other peoples, Midian Num 22:4 ; Num 22:7 , Moab v Num 22:7 (all E ), Egypt Ps 105:22 (|| שׂרים ); of Gebal Ezek 27:9 elders of a city, especially as sitting in the gate to judge Deut 19:12 ; Deut 21:2 (+ שֹׁפְטֶיךָ ) v Deut 21:3 v Deut 21:4 v Deut 21:6 v Deut 21:19 (+ שַׁעַרמְֿקֹמוֺ ), v Deut 21:20 ; Deut 22:15 (+ הַשָּׁ֑עְרָה ), v Deut 22:16 v Deut 22:17 v Deut 22:18 ; Deut 25:7 (+ הַשַּׁ֫עֲרָה ), v Deut 25:8 v Deut 25:9 (all in Deuteronomic code, and only so therein), Ruth 4:2 ; Ruth 4:4 ; Ruth 4:9 ; Ruth 4:11 (compare שַׁעַר v Ruth 4:1 v Ruth 4:11 ), מוֺשַׁב זְקֵנִים Ps 107:32 (|| קְהַלעָֿ֑ם ); Judg 8:14 (|| שׂרים ), v Judg 8:16 ; 1Sam 11:3 ; 1Sam 16:4 ; 1Kgs 21:8 ; 1Kgs 21:11 ; Ezra 10:14 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2434')\">BDB2434</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2205')\">H2205</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2433')\">BDB2433</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2435')\">BDB2435</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>זָקֵן</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>old</highlightword>, absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 19:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,4)\">Gen 19:4</ref> + 30 t. (on distinction from verb see above); construct <bdbheb>זְקַן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 24:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,2)\">Gen 24:2</ref> plural <bdbheb>זְקֵנִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 18:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,11)\">Gen 18:11</ref> + 44 t.; <bdbheb>זְקֵנוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 8:4\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(38,8,4)\">Zech 8:4</ref> construct <bdbheb>זִקְנֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 50:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,50,7)\">Gen 50:7</ref> + 85 t.; suffix <bdbheb>זְקֵנַי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 1:19\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(25,1,19)\">Lam 1:19</ref>, <bdbheb>זְקֵנֶיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 21:2\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(5,21,2)\">Deut 21:2</ref>; <